- **Concern**: Resume detection is placed after the lifecycle-title reject while paused issues intentionally keep [DESIGNING]. Scenario: Re-running /design on a paused issue exits at the title filter before design-pause-load.sh can see the marker, making every paused run non-resumable
- **Proposed resolution**: Move pause-marker detection before lifecycle rejection, or add a narrowly scoped title-filter bypass when larch:design-pause is present and design-pause-load succeeds

