- **Proposed resolution**: Add a mandatory write-design-current-env.sh re-invocation immediately after Step 0b binds ISSUE_NUMBER, passing --issue-number "$ISSUE_NUMBER" and --claude-pid "$PPID", before any pauseable Step 1c+ boundary

