- **Proposed resolution**: On LOAD_OK=true: restore into $DESIGN_TMPDIR, re-export SESSION_ID/RUN_ID/TIER/BRAINSTORM_DONE from marker, re-run write-design-current-env.sh, skip 0b items 3-6, then branch to STEP

